                                "sense_id": "37cb6165-ff91-3f8c-a594-19405b293773",
                                "text": "...they waved aside the tumblers of wine the young officer was pourin' out for 'em so freehanded, and said they should rather be excused."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b7ca748a-8999-326f-a3ad-b28682cbb0e7",
                        "entry_id": "0e8dd35b-75a5-3963-9b44-1937614e27d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unassisted."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5a6efbc-79b7-45c3-84ab-c95c84faded0",
                                "sense_id": "b7ca748a-8999-326f-a3ad-b28682cbb0e7",
                                "text": "Herrera and I were handicapped in the sense that we couldn't use the sight on our M-79s...We had to aim freehanded"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "28453bc3-072f-332f-ba45-c26cc5a2dd39",
                        "entry_id": "0e8dd35b-75a5-3963-9b44-1937614e27d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an unconstrained manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "646b6b45-d336-4be3-b680-52abb115caed",
                                "sense_id": "28453bc3-072f-332f-ba45-c26cc5a2dd39",
                                "text": "I am ordered over there with a few others. We all shoot standing and freehanded...This regained freedom of action makes us unable to feel the danger we are in."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
